var documenterSearchIndex = {"docs":
[{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch","text":"Documentation for MotifDatabaseSearch.\n\n","category":"section"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.MotifDB","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.MotifDB","text":"MotifDB\n\nContainer for all parsed motifs with indices for fast querying.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"type"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.MotifDatabaseIndex","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.MotifDatabaseIndex","text":"MotifDatabaseIndex\n\nIndex for scanning and querying raw MEME files on disk.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"type"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.MotifFile","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.MotifFile","text":"MotifFile\n\nRepresents a MEME motif file with extracted metadata (used during indexing).\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"type"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.MotifInfo","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.MotifInfo","text":"MotifInfo\n\nA single motif entry returned by queries. Contains the PWM matrix and all associated metadata.\n\nFields\n\nid            — motif identifier (e.g. \"MA0004.1\")\nname          — motif name (e.g. \"Arnt\")\nalphabet      — \"ACGT\", \"ACGU\", or amino-acid string\nsequence_type — \"dna\", \"rna\", \"protein\", \"unknown\"\nstrand        — e.g. \"+ -\"\nwidth         — number of positions (rows)\nnsites        — number of sites used to build the matrix\nevalue        — E-value from the MEME file\nurl           — source URL\nmatrix        — Matrix{Float64} of size (width × alphabet_length)\nsource_file   — relative path within the database root\ndatabase_name — top-level folder name (JASPAR, CIS-BP_1.02, …)\nspecies       — Vector{String} of species tags\nis_dna_encoded— true if the file is a DNA-encoded version of an RNA motif\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"type"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.ParsedMotif","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.ParsedMotif","text":"ParsedMotif\n\nA single motif parsed from a MEME file (intermediate representation).\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"type"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.build_index!-Tuple{MotifDatabaseSearch.MotifDatabaseIndex}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.build_index!","text":"build_index!(index; peek_files=true, verbose=true)\n\nScan the database folder and populate the MotifDatabaseIndex with all discovered MEME files and their metadata.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.build_json-Tuple{String, String}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.build_json","text":"build_json(database_root::String, output_path::String)\n\nScan all MEME files under database_root, parse every motif, and write a single JSON file to output_path.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.clear_cache!-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.clear_cache!","text":"clear_cache!()\n\nDelete the cached motif database. The next call to ensure_database() or load_motif_db() will re-download and re-parse everything.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.consensus-Tuple{MotifInfo}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.consensus","text":"consensus(pwm::MotifInfo) → String\n\nReturn the consensus sequence string.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.data_dir-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.data_dir","text":"data_dir() → String\n\nReturn the path to the package scratch space for storing the motif database. Creates the directory if it does not exist.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.database_exists-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.database_exists","text":"database_exists() → Bool\n\nReturn true if the parsed JSON cache already exists.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.detect_alphabet_from_file-Tuple{String}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.detect_alphabet_from_file","text":"detect_alphabet_from_file(filepath) → (sequence_type::Symbol, num_motifs::Int)\n\nPeek into a MEME file to detect the alphabet type and count motifs.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.download_and_extract-Tuple{String, String}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.download_and_extract","text":"download_and_extract(url::String, dest_dir::String) → String\n\nDownload the tarball from url, extract it into dest_dir, and return the path to the extracted motif_databases folder.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.ensure_database-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.ensure_database","text":"ensure_database(; url = DEFAULT_MOTIF_DB_URL, force = false)\n\nMake sure the parsed motifs.json cache exists. If it doesn't (or force is true), download the motif databases tarball, extract it, parse all MEME files, and write the JSON.\n\nThis is called automatically by load_motif_db() if no JSON is found.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.extract_species_from_filename-Tuple{String}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.extract_species_from_filename","text":"extract_species_from_filename(filename) → Vector{String}\n\nExtract species names from filename using Genus_species patterns.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.extract_species_from_path-Tuple{String, String}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.extract_species_from_path","text":"extract_species_from_path(folder, filename) → Vector{String}\n\nExtract species information from folder and filename context.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.get_db-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.get_db","text":"get_db(; force_reload=false) → MotifDB\n\nReturn the global MotifDB handle, downloading / parsing the database if needed and loading it on first access.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.information_content-Tuple{MotifInfo}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.information_content","text":"information_content(pwm::MotifInfo) → Vector{Float64}\n\nCompute the information content (bits) at each position.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.list_databases-Tuple{MotifDB}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.list_databases","text":"List all distinct database names in the database.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.list_sequence_types-Tuple{MotifDB}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.list_sequence_types","text":"List all distinct sequence types in the database.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.list_species-Tuple{MotifDB}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.list_species","text":"List all distinct species tags in the database.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.load_motif_db-Tuple{String}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.load_motif_db","text":"load_motif_db(json_path::String) → MotifDB\n\nLoad the JSON produced by the parsing step and build query indices.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.matrix_columns-Tuple{MotifInfo}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.matrix_columns","text":"matrix_columns(pwm::MotifInfo)\n\nGet the matrix as a named tuple of column vectors for easier access.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.motifs_json_path-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.motifs_json_path","text":"motifs_json_path() → String\n\nReturn the full path to the cached motifs.json.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.parse_meme_file-Tuple{String}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.parse_meme_file","text":"parse_meme_file(filepath; kwargs...) → Vector{ParsedMotif}\n\nParse all motifs from a single MEME-format file.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#MotifDatabaseSearch.query-Tuple{MotifDB}","page":"Home","title":"MotifDatabaseSearch.query","text":"query(db::MotifDB; kwargs...) → Vector{MotifInfo}\n\nReturn all MotifInfo entries matching the given criteria (AND-combined).\n\nKeyword arguments\n\nargument description\nspecies species name (case-insensitive substring match)\nsequence_type \"dna\", \"rna\", or \"protein\"\ndatabase database folder name (case-insensitive substring)\nmotif_id substring match on motif ID\nmotif_name substring match on motif name\nmin_width minimum number of positions\nmax_width maximum number of positions\ninclude_dna_encoded include DNA-encoded RNA motifs? (default true)\n\nExamples\n\ndb = get_db()\nquery(db; species=\"Homo_sapiens\", sequence_type=\"dna\", database=\"JASPAR\")\nquery(db; sequence_type=\"rna\", motif_name=\"RBFOX\")\nquery(db; species=\"Mus_musculus\", min_width=8, max_width=12)\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"}]
}
